# 🚀 Key Takeaways

> 🔹 **Serializer** → Converts Django/Python data into API-friendly data.

> 🔹 **ModelSerializer** → Automatically works with Django models.

> 🔹 **Validation** → Checks incoming data before processing or saving.

> 🔹 **Serialization** → Object → JSON.

> 🔹 **Deserialization** → JSON → Validated Python data.

> 🔹 **`is_valid()`** → Checks whether serializer input is valid.

> 🔹 **`serializer.data`** → Provides serialized output.

> 🔹 **`serializer.errors`** → Provides validation errors.

> 🔹 **`save()`** → Saves validated data to the database.

